  <div class="pl-cards">
    <details class="pl-card-d">
      <summary>FirestoreBackupService.kt — replace list accumulation with suspend onPage callback + A2b rehydration</summary>
      <div class="pl-card">
        <p>Extract <code>rehydrateLargeText(article, articleRef)</code> from the existing <code>restoreArticle()</code> large-text path. Redesign <code>restoreAllArticlesPaginated</code>: replace <code>allArticles.addAll(articles)</code> with a per-page <code>rehydrateLargeText</code> call followed by <code>onPage(hydratedArticles)</code>. Return type changes from <code>Result&lt;List&lt;Article&gt;&gt;</code> to <code>Result&lt;Unit&gt;</code>. Remove deprecated <code>restoreAllArticles()</code> entirely. Re-throw <code>CancellationException</code> in the catch block for cooperative cancellation.</p>
        <!-- @include diff-block { "lines": [
          { "kind": "rem", "text": "val allArticles = mutableListOf<Article>()" },
          { "kind": "rem", "text": "allArticles.addAll(articles)" },
          { "kind": "rem", "text": "Result.success(allArticles)" },
          { "kind": "add", "text": "onPage: suspend (List<Article>) -> Unit = {}" },
          { "kind": "add", "text": "val hydratedArticles = articles.map { rehydrateLargeText(it, getUserArticlesCollection(user.uid).document(it.itemId)) }" },
          { "kind": "add", "text": "onPage(hydratedArticles)" },
          { "kind": "add", "text": "Result.success(Unit)" },
          { "kind": "ctx", "text": "// suspend fun restoreAllArticles() — DELETED (hard cutover, zero callers)" }
        ] } -->
      </div>
    </details>

    <details class="pl-card-d">
      <summary>FirestoreSyncManager.kt — update both call sites to supply onPage lambda</summary>
      <div class="pl-card">
        <p>Two call sites (first-sync restore branch ~L427; <code>performBidirectionalSync</code> ~L492). Each replaces the <code>fold { remoteArticles -&gt; chunked(50) { handleRemoteArticleChange } }</code> block with an inline <code>onPage = { pageArticles -&gt; withContext(IO) { pageArticles.forEach { handleRemoteArticleChange(it) } } }</code> lambda. The outer <code>chunked(50)</code> evaporates since pages are already 50 articles. The <code>fold {}</code> collapses to <code>.onFailure { throw it }</code>.</p>
        <!-- @include diff-block { "lines": [
          { "kind": "rem", "text": "remoteResult.fold(" },
