          { "kind": "add", "text": "  onProgress = { current, total -> Timber.d(\"Restoring $current / $total articles\") }," },
          { "kind": "add", "text": "  onPage = { pageArticles -> withContext(Dispatchers.IO) { pageArticles.forEach { handleRemoteArticleChange(it) } } }" },
          { "kind": "add", "text": ").onFailure { throw it }" }
        ] } -->
      </div>
    </details>

    <details class="pl-card-d">
      <summary>FirestoreBackupServiceTest.kt — A2 streaming tests + A2b large-text rehydration tests</summary>
      <div class="pl-card">
        <p>Eight new unit tests covering the full edge-case matrix (A2: multi-page, zero articles, single page, onPage failure, cancellation; A2b: null-text rehydration, inline-text no-read, missing subcollection). All use MockK + <code>runTest</code> + <code>StandardTestDispatcher</code>. The test-net characterization test pinning the OOM accumulation baseline is updated or replaced in Step 6 (conditional on test-net having landed).</p>
